************************************
        !!! ATTENTION !!!

     X, Y, Z can be moved by
    X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- key
         or handwheel
  when the cursor is in line #3xx

       service tool changer
     (cam driven  double arm)

         normal operation
          (arm  forward)

      ! manual mode active !
   start function: key "NC start"
************************************

#301  S to TC position
#302  Z to TC position
#309  Pocket to vertical position
#311  Arm to unclamping position
#305  Tool unclamping
#312  Arm to clamping position
#306  Tool clamping
#313  Arm to standby position
#310  Pocket to horizontal position
#317  Magazine turning forward
#318  Magazine turning reverse
#319  Magazine reference (non-servo magazine)
#320  Delete spindle status (T0)

************************************
        !!! ATTENTION !!!
         normal operation
          (arm backward)
************************************

#301  S to TC position
#302  Z to TC position
#309  Pocket to vertical position
#314  Arm back to clamping position
#305  Tool unclamping
#315  Arm back to unclamping position
#306  Tool clamping
#316  Arm back to standby position
#310  Pocket to horizontal position
#317  Magazine turning forward
#318  Magazine turning reverse
#319  Magazine reference (non-servo magazine)
#320  Delete spindle status (T0)

